323	// cellStyle is the style one cell is rendered with.
324	//
325	// A row a view has coloured whole — error, busy, a CVE severity, via
326	// SelectedStyles or the busy override — drops every column's own colour and
327	// is handed to styles.Selected instead: a colour inside it would close with a
328	// reset that takes that solid background with it for the rest of the line.
329	// The highlight there answers "what state is this row in", and no per-cell
330	// colour is worth losing it to.
