344	// background, whether or not the column asked for either. Both halves are
345	// forced for the same reason and each fixes its own defect:
346	//
347	//   - Background: lipgloss does not inherit one (Rule 115), and the app's
348	//     viewport style only reaches the cells that emit nothing of their own. One
349	//     coloured cell would otherwise end its line with a reset and strip the

